// Careers & Recruitment prototype contract (M28 — Phase 6 form wireframes + Phase 7 owner-dashboard wireframes).
// Pages: docs/careers/wireframes/html (generated by docs/careers/wireframes/tools/build.py), served on :4175 (playwright.config.mjs).
// Owner values below are FROZEN (M28 §06–§21, §28, §34–§46, §51, §54): the tests fail if a wireframe adds, drops or renames one.
// Titles avoid "— AR"/"— EN" on purpose so scripts/qa-matrix.mjs keeps counting only the menu pages.
